    "detail": {
      "id": 1320602,
      "name": "[Billy] Rotating Drivetrain",
      "desc": "When Billy uses his <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>Assist Follow-Up</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, he <color=#2BAD00>gains 2/2/4/4 stacks of Charge</color> (up to 4 stacks). When Billy performs a piercing attack in a large area around him during <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Starlight Sanction</color>, press Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to <color=#2BAD00>consume 1 stack of Charge</color> and trigger the skill repeatedly, <color=#2BAD00>increasing its DMG by 150%</color>. When the effect is triggered, Billy's <color=#2BAD00>CRIT Rate increases by 20%</color> for 10s. The effect stacks up to 2 times. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
